{"availability":"available","full":"Sev7eNup/NodePilot","name":"NodePilot","description":"Agentless Windows workflow orchestration. Self-hosted, open source, alternative to System Center Orchestrator with SCOrch workflow import.","category":"Developer tools","language":"C#","stars":105,"forks":11,"created":"2026-07-21T19:32:05Z","updated":"2026-10-09T21:26:54Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.nodepilot.run","topics":["automation","dotnet","enterprise-software","low-code","orchestration","powershell","scorch","system-center-orchestrator","windows","winrm","workflow-automation"],"demo":"https://www.nodepilot.run/demo/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.147Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.147Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.147Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.147Z","stars":105,"forks":11}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Multi-step automation is designed, scheduled, debugged and observed in the browser. PowerShell, file, registry and service operations, REST calls, SQL and further activities are executed across a Windows estate over WinRM, without agents on the targets.","🌐 Website · ▶️ Live demo · 📚 Documentation · ⬇️ Download · 🚀 Install","NodePilot is agentless workflow orchestration for Windows, built in the browser and running PowerShell on remote machines over WinRM. It is meant for sysadmins automating Windows estates, for organizations looking for a modern alternative to SCOrch, as well as for private users who rely heavily on PowerShell."],"features":["Visual designer: drag-and-drop canvas with 29 activity types, 6 triggers and a visual condition builder.","Custom Activities: your own PowerShell-based activities, reusable from the palette like the built-in ones.","Sub-workflows: a workflow calls another with parameters and gets its return values back.","Parallel engine: branches really run in parallel and meet again at a junction.","Step debugger: breakpoints, step-over, variable inspection and overrides at runtime, replay in the timeline."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sev7eNup/NodePilot/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"969e039dbd8cc1ce23162fbf63766285a626adcf8f50aac707cc969e539a6a31","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.248Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.248Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Multi-step automation is designed, scheduled, debugged and observed in the browser. PowerShell, file, registry and service operations, REST calls, SQL and further activities are executed across a Windows estate over WinRM, without agents on the targets.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sev7eNup/NodePilot/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Each one leads to a working login on its own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sev7eNup/NodePilot/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"On every path the first login creates the Admin account with a one-time setup token.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sev7eNup/NodePilot/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"969e039dbd8cc1ce23162fbf63766285a626adcf8f50aac707cc969e539a6a31","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sev7eNup/NodePilot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.249Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T21:26:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sev7eNup/NodePilot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.250Z","hash":"969e039dbd8cc1ce23162fbf63766285a626adcf8f50aac707cc969e539a6a31","originalBytes":30805,"storedBytes":30805,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","nodepilot","windows","server","deploy","desktop","powershell","workflow","readme.md","documentation","every","api","installer","core","postgresql","service","what","workflows","database","engine","grafana","local","run","runs","setup","tests","under","admin","license","path","security","system","activities